@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180

### Register a temporary pairing invite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pairings/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invite": "unclip-pair:v1:example"
}

### Claim a PIN returned by the registration request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pairings/123456/claim

### A missing or expired PIN returns 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pairings/000000/claim
